    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/28b30c42e566b24fb991c387f7cc1eb4.poster.avif?t=1753795755\" width=800 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/28b30c42e566b24fb991c387f7cc1eb4.webm?t=1753795755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Music is our past and future.&quot; Dive into a rich tower-defense RPG inspired by music!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/cc4e2a69694c7fae8c2226f5cf0f8596.avif?t=1753795755\" width=616 height=86 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/4011a292098c8d710c15f3ecebcf9eb2.poster.avif?t=1753795755\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/4011a292098c8d710c15f3ecebcf9eb2.webm?t=1753795755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/4011a292098c8d710c15f3ecebcf9eb2.mp4?t=1753795755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each character is intricately designed based on different instruments and genres of music. Enjoy their HD splash art in skill cut-ins, alongside adorable chibis on the battlefield.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/848a81a810ed16824d1f8570f2c8945c.avif?t=1753795755\" width=616 height=86 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/1e9c9c4f242020519b65974be91d44b7.poster.avif?t=1753795755\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/1e9c9c4f242020519b65974be91d44b7.webm?t=1753795755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/1e9c9c4f242020519b65974be91d44b7.mp4?t=1753795755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>10 Musical Genres and 7 Virtuoso Archetypes available at launch. Raise and create your own line-up of Virtuosos, and make the intense real-time combat gameplay yours. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/e256835b040b24acd961c2a933862f6c.avif?t=1753795755\" width=616 height=86 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/06ac88ce78861d84ca1497cd2a09029b.poster.avif?t=1753795755\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/06ac88ce78861d84ca1497cd2a09029b.webm?t=1753795755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/06ac88ce78861d84ca1497cd2a09029b.mp4?t=1753795755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Test your strategy by deploying Virtuosos to defend against waves of enemies in thrilling tower defense battles. Combine musical abilities and unique archetypes to overcome complex challenges and keep the rhythm alive! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/e16b347f1d049903acc60785f724b90e.avif?t=1753795755\" width=616 height=86 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/c07a3186e8557a519f9b54cbf5d969fc.poster.avif?t=1753795755\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/c07a3186e8557a519f9b54cbf5d969fc.webm?t=1753795755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/c07a3186e8557a519f9b54cbf5d969fc.mp4?t=1753795755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enter a detailed world that hides many secrets, and experience a visual novel-styled story that takes you through twists and turns. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/d3fcda9beb9040a2f93e4c2e66a39461.avif?t=1753795755\" width=616 height=86 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/b7e2e3da856e8b1c8e21d7d4ce9a5b47.poster.avif?t=1753795755\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/b7e2e3da856e8b1c8e21d7d4ce9a5b47.webm?t=1753795755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/b7e2e3da856e8b1c8e21d7d4ce9a5b47.mp4?t=1753795755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world based on music, represented by its music. Hear the tracks changing based on your gameplay! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/28b30c42e566b24fb991c387f7cc1eb4.poster.avif?t=1753795755\" width=800 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/28b30c42e566b24fb991c387f7cc1eb4.webm?t=1753795755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/28b30c42e566b24fb991c387f7cc1eb4.poster.avif?t=1753795755\" width=800 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/28b30c42e566b24fb991c387f7cc1eb4.webm?t=1753795755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Music is our past and future.&quot; Dive into a rich tower-defense RPG inspired by music!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/cc4e2a69694c7fae8c2226f5cf0f8596.avif?t=1753795755\" width=616 height=86 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/4011a292098c8d710c15f3ecebcf9eb2.poster.avif?t=1753795755\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/4011a292098c8d710c15f3ecebcf9eb2.webm?t=1753795755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/4011a292098c8d710c15f3ecebcf9eb2.mp4?t=1753795755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each character is intricately designed based on different instruments and genres of music. Enjoy their HD splash art in skill cut-ins, alongside adorable chibis on the battlefield.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/848a81a810ed16824d1f8570f2c8945c.avif?t=1753795755\" width=616 height=86 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https