<video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/c07a3186e8557a519f9b54cbf5d969fc.poster.avif?t=1753795755\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/c07a3186e8557a519f9b54cbf5d969fc.webm?t=1753795755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/c07a3186e8557a519f9b54cbf5d969fc.mp4?t=1753795755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enter a detailed world that hides many secrets, and experience a visual novel-styled story that takes you through twists and turns. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/d3fcda9beb9040a2f93e4c2e66a39461.avif?t=1753795755\" width=616 height=86 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/b7e2e3da856e8b1c8e21d7d4ce9a5b47.poster.avif?t=1753795755\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/b7e2e3da856e8b1c8e21d7d4ce9a5b47.webm?t=1753795755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/b7e2e3da856e8b1c8e21d7d4ce9a5b47.mp4?t=1753795755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world based on music, represented by its music. Hear the tracks changing based on your gameplay! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/28b30c42e566b24fb991c387f7cc1eb4.poster.avif?t=1753795755\" width=800 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180780/extras/28b30c42e566b24fb991c387f7cc1eb4.webm?t=1753795755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Sonata is a Tower-Defense RPG set in a post-apocalyptic world where sound attracts the monstrous &quot;Echoes&quot;. A girl begins her journey to find her brother and discover the truth about her family's abilities. Join her and the Virtuosos of The Institute as she searches for the truth of the world.",
